    "body": "Also had a question about how this works for navigations. It seems to me that if the parent document has cors-or-credentialless, the child can have either that or require-corp. But if the parent has require-corp, the child shouldn't be allowed to have cors-or-credentialless perhaps as that's weaker? (Especially once most things cross-origin are without credentials anyway.)",
