    "body": "So for iframes, we propose a separate solution via an iframe attribute. I have put together an [explainer](https://github.com/camillelamy/explainers/blob/master/anonymous_iframes.md) detailing the solution. This is separate from `COEP: credentialless`. We envision `COEP: credentialless` as an easy way to deploy COEP on first party frames that embed a lot of unpersonalized cross-origin subresources (e.g. images from a CDN).",
